        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D11904, Classic 904 Lever Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 904 door lever lockset is for use on residential and commercial entry doors. Built to withstand heavy use, the Classic 904 Lever Entryset combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive designs. The Omnia D11904 features a tulip shaped lever and an arched backplate for a beautiful and traditional lockset that will sure to add elegance to any door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/classic-solid-brass-leverset-omnia-904-00\"> Classic Door Lever</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit narrow stiles. For Door with a 2-3⁄8” backset, stile width can be as narrow as 3-5⁄8”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D11904 Classic Lever Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li></li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: \"T\" strike</li>\r\n<li>Each set contains door levers, backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/entry-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Entry Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic 904 Lever Entryset",
                "description": "The Omnia 904 door lever lockset is for use on residential and commercial entry doors. Built to withstand heavy use, the Classic 904 Lever Entryset combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive designs. The Omnia D11904 features a tulip shaped lever and an arched backplate for a beautiful and traditional lockset that will sure to add elegance to any door.\r\n",
